ust endorse Mitt  Romney to become me the next US senator  from Utah yeah so I don't think that's  going to convince anyone of anything now  that's just one vote in the Senate out  of a hundred it's not nearly as powerful  as the Secretary of State no doubt it is  something it's something but in the  grand scheme of things and particularly  in retrospect Russia also wouldn't have  as much  of an interest in trying to prevent  senator romney it appears at least  circumstantially that they'd have a  pretty significant interest in  preventing Secretary of State Romney  today's program is made possible in part  by futur vitur is a social forecasting  game where you compete with other  players to predict the future and it's  built on the principles of what's called  a prediction market a scientifically  proven way of using the wisdom of the  crowd to create more accurate  predictions about future events  prediction markets have been shown to  work much better than other forecasting  methods like polling or expert analysis  in many cases and futur has actually  taken the concept and turned it into a  fun easy to use social game you open up  the futur app and you'll see a whole  range of forecasts covering topics  across the board from politics to sports  and everything in between you can check  out my predictions and follow me to get  updates on my profile which is linked to  in the description if you're watching  this on youtube the tour is a great tool  to find out more about the world improve  your forecasting ability show off your  prediction skills to friends and even  better when you make predictions on  futur you're helping to create more  accurate forecasts for everybody their  mission of creating better predictions  is great and actually going in there and  seeing how well you can do at predicting  the future can be kind of addicting go  to futur com sign up and start making  forecast it's free and it's available on  both Android and iOS as well as on web  browse